  "content": "\n\n<p>这是一个库模组，为列于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/CyclopsMC</a> 的模组所必需。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>欢迎在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/9yDxubB\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cyclops Discord 服务器</a> 的 #cyclopscore 频道与我们交流！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模组允许您通过 XML 声明自定义合成配方，更多信息请参阅&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/CyclopsCore/wiki/Recipe-XML\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基页面</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/packages/packages/\" rel=\"nofollow\">开发版本</a> 作为 GitHub Packages 托管。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模组会收集<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/CyclopsCore/blob/master-1.9/src/main/java/org/cyclops/cyclopscore/tracking/Analytics.java\" rel=\"nofollow\">匿名启动数据</a>，您可以在配置文件中禁用此功能，并且它遵循 Minecraft 的收集者设置。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcyclops\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/banner/console-affiliation-banners/banner_abd7c360-8f9d-4395-8382-b28f26a2d6b2.png\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a><br>在 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcyclops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 租用服务器时，请使用推荐码 <strong>cyclops</strong> 支持我们，即可享受<strong>首月立减25%</strong>！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kroeser\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c14.patreon.com/Patreon_Wordmark_fb38c295a1.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"56\"></a><br>如果您喜欢此模组，请考虑在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kroeser\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 上支持我！</p>",
